WEBVTT

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:15.140
The city will disappear soon.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:20.610
We won't even realize it happened.

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:23.490
It will be as though neither time nor space...

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:27.800
...ever existed there.

00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:30.740
If that experiment...

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.080
...opened that forbidden door...

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:39.250
...mankind is currently suffering the consequences.

00:00:42.490 --> 00:00:43.900
Is that your decision?

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:48.770
It won't be easy.

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:51.350
Yes.

00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:39.010
<i>Asura Cryin' 2</i>

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:26.960
They said she collapsed during PE.

00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:29.860
Takatsuki-san is pushing herself too hard.

00:02:32.350 --> 00:02:32.970
That day...

00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:35.350
The day the passenger jet was hijacked...

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:37.790
...Takatsuki fought against Kagakagari...

00:02:38.410 --> 00:02:39.640
...to save me.

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:41.560
She used up much of her magic.

00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:43.240
What if...

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:45.790
...Takatsuki is already...

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:51.600
Takatsuki!

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:52.310
Huh?

00:02:52.890 --> 00:02:53.740
Uh, what?

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:01.010
W-wait, Takatsuki!

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:03.680
I was just--ow!

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:05.040
Ania!

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:06.780
You pervert!

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:08.500
It's a misunderstanding!

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:10.910
Ouch!

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:20.820
You really took a lot of Tomoharu's luck.

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:23.640
Just be glad you aren't dead.

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:25.210
Ow!

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:26.560
Natsume-kun!

00:03:33.970 --> 00:03:35.030
I-I'm sorry!

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:36.600
Are you alright?

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:38.100
Y-yeah.

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:44.430
I'm assume you know what you're doing, Tomoharu Natsume.

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:49.690
"The Disappearing World and the Ruins of Memory"

00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:51.740
Well?

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:54.480
What on Earth were you doing to make this happen?

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:57.540
I fell and tripped in the school yard...

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:00.400
...so Kanade brought me to the nurse's office.

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:01.720
Huh? Really?

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:03.790
You just misread the situation, Tomoharu.

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:07.500
Why does the Science Club always have to get into trouble?

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:11.210
Try to hold still, Natsume-kun.

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:11.910
Sure.

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:13.630
Tomoharu Natsume.

00:04:14.130 --> 00:04:17.130
It seems you still don't understand your position.

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:17.770
Huh?

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:19.570
You're a handler...

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:22.950
...in close contact with the demon Kanade Takatsuki.

00:04:23.340 --> 00:04:26.780
You're practically an Asura Cryin'.

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:30.940
Is that really a reason to point a gun at...

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:32.250
If anything happens...

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:36.100
...the First Student Council will do everything we can to eliminate you.

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:37.180
Hey!

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:39.020
Reishiro.

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:43.020
The Science Club is under the Third Student Council's jurisdiction.

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:45.360
You'll stay out of our business.

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:47.320
But...

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:48.940
Don't worry.

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:50.880
I have no intention of coddling them.

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:52.880
As your punishment...

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:55.790
...you'll clean the school pool.

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:58.820
Sucks to be you, Tomoharu.

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:00.020
Shuri Kurosaki.

00:05:01.090 --> 00:05:02.230
Since there's no president...

00:05:02.770 --> 00:05:07.780
...as the acting president, you'll be responsible for the Science Club.

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:16.400
What's Reishiro's problem?

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:18.740
He was ignoring me.

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:19.320
Huh?

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:21.240
He acted like I wasn't there.

00:05:21.390 --> 00:05:22.590
You think so?

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:23.980
You're just imagining things.

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:31.020
Tomo?

00:05:37.090 --> 00:05:37.730
A koala?

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:40.010
What's wrong, Nia?

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:41.330
There's a koala!

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:42.320
What?

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:43.420
Where?

00:05:43.960 --> 00:05:44.400
Huh?

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:47.520
Are you sure it wasn't something else?

00:05:47.670 --> 00:05:50.190
No! There really was a koala!

00:05:50.610 --> 00:05:52.350
It was walking on two legs!

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:53.590
Sure, sure.

00:06:04.810 --> 00:06:06.620
I really did see a koala.

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:08.520
Hey, Tomo.

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:14.030
Whatever happened to the igniter Kagakagari was after?

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:16.660
It's missing.

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:20.970
Shuri-san told me the tracking device on it stopped working, too.

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:25.940
The G.D.'s are doing everything they can to find it...

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:27.940
...so I'm sure it will turn up eventually.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.300
Takatsuki!

00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:33.450
I-I'm sorry!

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:35.150
My hand slipped.

00:06:42.520 --> 00:06:43.430
Let's go get it!

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:44.220
Yes!

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:46.250
Takatsuki!

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:47.000
Over there!

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:48.840
Watch out!

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:55.860
There it is! It's the koala!

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:04.910
What is she doing?

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:06.880
Shuri!

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:11.520
Nia!

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:13.900
Tomoharu, the koala!

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:15.350
Hey, Nia!

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:16.240
Wait!

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:17.380
Damn it.

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:23.920
I wonder if I was too harsh with them.

00:07:25.350 --> 00:07:27.070
They just went through that incident.

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:30.010
I'm sure there was a reason.

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:36.320
No one's here!

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:37.980
Where did they go?

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:42.720
They didn't even drain the water.

00:07:55.210 --> 00:07:57.090
Did you trip, Nia?

00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:02.090
I almost got the koala, but he got away.

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:04.490
I'm telling you, there is no koala.

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:05.900
It's real!

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:06.970
I saw it!

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:09.440
Let's get out of here.

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:14.240
What is this?

00:08:15.710 --> 00:08:17.780
Which way did we come from?

00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:20.310
Does that mean we're lost?

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:21.800
This can't be good.

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:23.730
Why? What's wrong?

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:26.710
The Rakuroa ruins are down here.

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:27.700
Ruins?

00:08:28.510 --> 00:08:29.380
Rakuroa...

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:31.080
...the ruins of the first world.

00:08:31.640 --> 00:08:33.460
It that true, Shuri?

00:08:34.020 --> 00:08:35.280
Probably.

00:08:36.090 --> 00:08:38.010
Why aren't you sure?

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:41.240
Well, I've never seen them myself.

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:43.480
Then how do you know about them?

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:45.280
In the past there was just one person...

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:48.910
...who made it back from there alive.

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:50.150
Impossible!

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:52.650
Even among the ruins of the first world...

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:54.730
...Rakuroa is one of the most important cultural properties.

00:08:55.530 --> 00:08:57.770
Guarded by special Castas Machina...

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:00.540
...it's not accessible to normal humans.

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:03.980
Who was it?

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:06.720
Naotaka Natsume.

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:10.550
The koala!

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:17.920
Tomo, something's coming!

00:09:18.150 --> 00:09:18.440
Huh?

00:09:31.260 --> 00:09:31.880
Tomo.

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:32.560
Tomo!

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:37.430
What was that?

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:39.890
Someone must have drained the pool.

00:09:40.590 --> 00:09:43.020
All the water came down here.

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:44.900
Who would do something like that?

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:50.240
We still need to find an exit.

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:52.090
The koala!

00:09:57.060 --> 00:09:59.400
He must be showing us the way!

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:00.140
Let's go!

00:10:00.230 --> 00:10:01.650
Wait, what?

00:10:08.410 --> 00:10:08.940
Huh?

00:10:10.270 --> 00:10:11.910
I'm... outside?

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:16.540
Are we really just going to follow him?

00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:18.820
I guess. We don't know where we are.

00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:27.870
That was close.

00:10:30.460 --> 00:10:32.430
The koala's trying to save you!

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:35.530
I'm pretty sure he's trying to make me fall!

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:06.000
A dead end?

00:11:11.300 --> 00:11:14.670
Koala, what do you have against me?

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:24.570
Amazing!

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:27.330
It's probably just another trap.

00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:29.000
I can't say it isn't.

00:11:48.260 --> 00:11:49.610
What is this place?

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:51.970
Hey!

00:11:53.360 --> 00:11:54.140
Natsume-kun.

00:11:55.430 --> 00:11:55.840
That.

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:02.120
The Rakuroa ruins...

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:06.090
What is this doing under our school?

00:12:08.560 --> 00:12:10.440
"Third Student Council Office"

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:12.370
What? Intruders in Rakuroa?

00:12:12.740 --> 00:12:14.210
Tomoharu Natsume?

00:12:28.990 --> 00:12:30.590
These are the Rakuroa ruins?

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:33.760
My brother came here?

00:12:35.580 --> 00:12:36.260
Stop, Tomo!

00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:37.090
Look over there!

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:43.450
What are they?

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:46.910
They're the Castas Machina guarding Rakuroa.

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:47.760
Are they bad?

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:51.750
No, if we don't do anything, they shouldn't...

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:52.970
Hey, koala!

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:53.530
What are you...

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:00.550
Run!

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:05.830
Sheesh.

00:13:06.250 --> 00:13:07.600
What did the koala do that for?

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:10.410
You little...!

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:11.380
Hey, Tomo.

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:14.390
Doesn't this place seem familiar?

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:15.280
Huh?

00:13:15.800 --> 00:13:17.370
Like a museum...

00:13:18.550 --> 00:13:19.300
...or a hospital?

00:13:19.670 --> 00:13:20.810
A research facility.

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:22.670
Yeah, exactly!

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:26.460
What is this?

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:30.000
Natsume-kun!

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:31.850
Ouch.

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:55.200
Misao?

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:22.850
Thanks.

00:14:23.510 --> 00:14:27.810
There's something I want to talk to you about after our next track meet.

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:28.620
What?

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:30.850
I'll tell you after the meet.

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:32.720
It's a secret for now.

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:36.620
Tomo!

00:14:37.990 --> 00:14:39.260
Watch it, Misao!

00:14:39.970 --> 00:14:41.490
Tomo, you stink!

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:50.860
Who's is going to be, Tomo? Takatsuki or Misao-chan?

00:14:51.010 --> 00:14:54.050
What? It's not like that.

00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:55.360
Oh, go on.

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:02.350
Another black hole experiment?

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:03.520
Looks like it.

00:15:06.350 --> 00:15:07.620
Hope you didn't wait long!

00:15:08.020 --> 00:15:10.400
I brought you a special treat!

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:11.570
Misao.

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:15.820
I bet Nao-kun's so caught up in his work he's forgotten to eat.

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:21.800
The experiment failed!

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:23.670
We're losing control over the black hole!

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:27.830
Misao!

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:29.350
We can't control it!

00:15:29.350 --> 00:15:30.760
Run! Hurry!

00:15:56.750 --> 00:16:00.340
Done with your rounds, Castas Machina?

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:03.130
Tell me, Ritsu-san.

00:16:04.090 --> 00:16:07.580
What happened after the black hole experiment failed?

00:16:08.550 --> 00:16:11.030
Two worlds collided.

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:13.860
Because of it, the city and the people...

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:16.190
...everything started falling apart.

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:20.190
Is that why Misao...?

00:16:22.570 --> 00:16:24.800
Without anyone realizing it...

00:16:25.060 --> 00:16:26.270
...this world will disappear.

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:29.010
Is there no way to stop it?

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:30.630
There is a way.

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:31.790
However...

00:16:37.820 --> 00:16:40.400
They say I'm vanishing.

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:43.090
Does it bother you?

00:16:47.850 --> 00:16:50.020
Will you love me forever?

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:51.290
Yes.

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:55.900
Ritsu.

00:17:03.090 --> 00:17:03.650
Misao.

00:17:05.730 --> 00:17:06.640
I'll do it.

00:17:08.050 --> 00:17:09.520
Is that your decision?

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:12.310
It won't be easy.

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:13.730
Yes.

00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:15.750
I'll save Misao...

00:17:16.820 --> 00:17:18.490
...I'll save the world, no matter the cost.

00:17:29.170 --> 00:17:30.140
Natsume-kun!

00:17:34.390 --> 00:17:35.860
What was that?

00:17:36.210 --> 00:17:37.480
What? What happened?

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:40.420
You didn't see that?

00:17:41.130 --> 00:17:41.940
What are you talking about?

00:17:51.310 --> 00:17:51.910
Shuri-san!

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:53.890
Hello, Tomoharu.

00:17:53.890 --> 00:17:55.160
I'm here to save you.

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:00.930
Over here.

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:02.250
What is this?

00:18:02.450 --> 00:18:05.130
Getting in here was a pain so I just broke through the wall.

00:18:05.590 --> 00:18:08.270
I guess that ticked off the Castas Machina.

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:10.860
Aren't you taking this a little lightly?

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:19.110
Takatsuki!

00:18:20.980 --> 00:18:22.100
Stop, Takatsuki!

00:18:22.350 --> 00:18:23.870
You can't use your powers!

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:25.800
Tomo, call Kurogane!

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:26.560
Huh?

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:30.100
What are you doing? Hurry up, Tomo!

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:44.740
Touo, draw!

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:50.560
Hey.

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:52.330
Yo! What are you doing here?

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:54.610
It's my job, Shuri.

00:18:55.580 --> 00:19:00.940
Guardian Dragoons are there to sort things out when a handler starts trouble on school grounds.

00:19:01.350 --> 00:19:02.010
Besides...

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:05.650
...I have a personal grudge against these guys.

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:15.020
Yo! Be careful with her!

00:19:26.170 --> 00:19:26.820
This doesn't look good.

00:19:26.820 --> 00:19:28.040
The roof is collapsing.

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:29.460
Get out of here!

00:19:29.860 --> 00:19:30.720
But...

00:19:31.130 --> 00:19:31.840
Understood!

00:19:38.520 --> 00:19:40.700
Yo! Let's go!

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:52.810
That was close.

00:19:53.720 --> 00:19:55.790
I thought we were done for.

00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:56.960
What do you care?

00:19:58.170 --> 00:20:01.260
Tomo, why didn't you call Kurogane?

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:01.820
Huh?

00:20:02.480 --> 00:20:05.970
Those robot crabs would have been no match for Kurogane.

00:20:06.380 --> 00:20:09.270
Oh, uh... I panicked.

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:17.980
Natsume-kun.

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:19.450
I saw it, too.

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:20.210
Huh?

00:20:20.810 --> 00:20:24.860
I think I saw what you saw at the ruins.

00:20:26.380 --> 00:20:29.120
I think they were echoes of the past.

00:20:29.420 --> 00:20:32.870
We saw visions of the first world.

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:34.870
So then...

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:38.340
That wasn't a dream or an illusion.

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:42.590
They were the memories remaining at the Rakuroa ruins.

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:48.410
Tomoharu!

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:50.950
Can I keep him?

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:52.370
Absolutely not.

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:58.290
It's his fault we were attacked by Castas Machina!

00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:05.380
Come here.

00:21:05.690 --> 00:21:06.600
No one's going to hurt you.

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:07.860
Come on.

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:09.530
It's okay.

00:21:09.740 --> 00:21:12.570
You just did that because you were scared, right?

00:21:15.110 --> 00:21:15.920
What are they doing?

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:16.470
I don't know.

00:21:16.930 --> 00:21:17.790
Come here!

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:25.440
What are you doing here?

00:21:25.990 --> 00:21:28.430
N-nothing!

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:29.890
I don't need your excuses!

00:21:31.260 --> 00:21:32.270
It can talk?

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:35.820
President Toru, is that...?

00:21:36.380 --> 00:21:37.690
Oh, excuse me.

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:40.630
Come on, introduce yourself.

00:21:41.640 --> 00:21:42.610
Nice to meet you.

00:21:42.910 --> 00:21:44.530
I'm the president of the Science Club.

00:21:45.040 --> 00:21:45.540
Huh?

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:49.190
What?

00:23:20.350 --> 00:23:21.670
That time.

00:23:21.820 --> 00:23:22.880
That day.

00:23:23.040 --> 00:23:24.350
If you had laughed.

00:23:24.350 --> 00:23:25.570
If you had stopped.

00:23:25.740 --> 00:23:27.620
Voyage at sea.

00:23:27.720 --> 00:23:30.050
A little boat swallowed by the darkness.

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:31.060
I missed you.

00:23:31.590 --> 00:23:35.000
"The Burial Doll Eaten by the Demon"
